<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00519">
	<title>Safe exit</title>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none" id="e03934">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="FormatA">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig id="e03935">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_TK25Z017_E.eps" align="center" placement="break" height="1.575in" width="2.244in" id="e03936"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e03937">
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol outputclass="a1804409">Driver assistance</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol outputclass="a1804496">Safe exit</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>With the vehicle on, select <menucascade><uicontrol>Setup</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver assistance</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driving safety</uicontrol><uicontrol>Safe exit</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system.</p>
		<note type="warning" id="e03938">
			<p>The driver should always be aware of his or her surroundings. If <uicontrol>Safe exit</uicontrol> is deselected, Safe Exit Assist cannot assist you.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="note" id="e03939">
			<p>If the vehicle is restarted, Safe Exit Assist will maintain the last setting.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="caution" id="e03940">
			<p>When the vehicle and the trailer are connected electrically, Safe Exit Assist automatically turns off. In this case, you cannot get help from Safe Exit Assist. Always drive with care. (if Kia genuine part equipped)</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>